sequenceDiagram
      participant OpenMRS
      participant OpenELIS
      participant OdooConnect as Odoo Connect
      participant Odoo
      actor Staff as Billing Staff

      Note over OpenMRS,OdooConnect: Patient & Visit Sync
      OpenMRS->>OdooConnect: Atomfeed: patient/visit/order events
      OdooConnect->>Odoo: REST API — create/update patient, sale order

      Note over OpenELIS,OdooConnect: Lab Test Catalog Sync
      OpenELIS->>OdooConnect: Atomfeed: test catalog events
      OdooConnect->>Odoo: REST API — sync lab test products

      Note over Odoo,OpenMRS: Drug/Product Catalog Sync
      Odoo->>OdooConnect: Atomfeed: drug/product events
      OdooConnect->>OpenMRS: REST API — sync drug concepts

      Staff->>Odoo: Generate invoice for patient visit
      Odoo-->>Staff: Invoice created